{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_responsibility_split", "label": "Clerk Responsibility Split (frontend vs API)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sign-in and session UI stay on Next.js with @clerk/nextjs; the NestJS API owns registration, JWT verification, webhooks and Postgres RBAC. Frontends never POST credentials to the API to authenticate, so the API never handles passwords except at account creation."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_post_auth_register", "label": "POST /auth/register", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only unauthenticated write endpoint; IP rate-limited via REGISTER_THROTTLE_LIMIT (default 5/hour) because it creates real Clerk accounts. Reversed a prior out-of-scope decision on 2026-08-03 because the product needs self-serve sign-up before booking."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_sign_in_ticket", "label": "Sign-in ticket (signInToken)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single-use, 60s TTL (CLERK_SIGN_IN_TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS). Treated as a credential: redeem immediately, never log, persist, or place in a URL. It lets the API own sign-up while Clerk still establishes the session."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_two_step_signup", "label": "Two-step sign-up flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Form 1 creates the account, form 2 fills the client or chef profile after the Clerk session exists, so profile data is written under an authenticated identity."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_route_selects_role", "label": "Route-selects-the-role rule", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "role is absent from every DTO on the sign-up path, so forbidNonWhitelisted turns a submitted role into 400. A sign-up form may show a client/chef choice but must map it to the endpoint, never to a body field; admin has no public surface at all."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_chef_vetting", "label": "Chef vetting flags (is_active / is_verified)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-registered chefs are always created inactive and unverified and neither field is accepted by PATCH /me/chef-profile, so a chef cannot self-habilitate. Only PATCH /admin/chefs/:id/verification may flip them. Known gap: no code reads the flags yet."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_get_me_sync", "label": "GET /me first sign-in sync", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The primary Clerk to Postgres sync path; it works even when webhooks have not arrived, so the frontend must call it after every sign-in/sign-up before relying on LF user data."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_ensurepersistedfromclerk", "label": "ensurePersistedFromClerk", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Upserts the users row from the JWT sub plus Clerk BAPI profile data. Called before role changes in PATCH /admin/users/:id/role so email, name and phone are present when elevating a user."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_admin_provisioning", "label": "Admin user provisioning routes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /admin/users and PATCH /admin/users/:id/role require a real CLERK_SECRET_KEY and answer 503 in local stub mode, because they must reach the Clerk Backend API."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_bapi_email_autoverification", "label": "Clerk BAPI email auto-verification gap", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "users.createUser auto-verifies email addresses, so both admin provisioning and public sign-up skip the Dashboard's frontend verification step. Nothing proves address ownership, so typo'd and disposable addresses reach users; rate limiting only blunts bulk abuse."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_first_admin_bootstrap", "label": "First admin bootstrap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There is deliberately no self-serve promote-me-to-admin endpoint; the first admin is promoted by SQL, and subsequent roles via the admin route."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_profile_type_switch_409", "label": "Profile type switch blocked with 409", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Switching client to chef after onboarding is refused because reconciling the orphaned profile, bookings and payouts is real work planned separately."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_local_stub_mode", "label": "Local Clerk stub mode (sk_test_placeholder)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decode-only stub tokens, GET /me sourced from the JWT sub alone, admin provisioning 503, webhooks unverified. Lets the API run with no Clerk cloud dependency."}, {"id": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_clerkauthguard", "label": "ClerkAuthGuard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_two_step_signup", "target": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_post_auth_register", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_post_auth_register", "target": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_sign_in_ticket", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_two_step_signup", "target": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_route_selects_role", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/auth/clerk-integration-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_auth_clerk_integration_contract_route_selects_role",